    url: "https://www.consumerfinance.gov/ask-cfpb/what-is-a-debt-relief-program-and-how-do-i-know-if-i-should-use-one-en-1457/",
    accessed: "2026-09-27",
  },
  {
    title: "U.S. Courts, Chapter 7 Bankruptcy Basics",
